            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tash"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Super easy. I made this with my 7 year old to go in the Fudge Puddles recipe on this site. It was the first time I made fudge and my daughter didn't want to stir and stopped a couple times and it still turned out great. We did use real cream instead of skim milk though. We also weighed the sugar, 187.5 grams.",
            "datePublished": "2013-08-05T09:08:33.277Z"
          },
          {
